.TH TAC 1
.SH NAME
tac \- print lines of a file in reverse order
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tac
.RI [ file ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Tac
prints the lines of each
.I file
(standard input if none given) in reverse order, last line first \(em
.B cat
backwards.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/cmd/tac.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR cat (1)
